------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web source reproduced)
------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : useVehicles (host-resolved vehicleID), useCostForecast(vehicleId)
               -> ChargingStore.costForecast feed (Resource<JsonElement>),
               useFormatting (currency symbol + precision)
binding      : CostForecastModel (@MainActor @Observable) -> StateHolderModel ->
               LoadableState<CostForecast> (same shape as VehicleSettingsModel;
               no direct HTTP from the view)
layout       : compact (cols<=1) = Next Month + Trend, no chart;
               standard (cols>=2) = title + trend icon, Next Month / Avg $/kWh /
               Trend stats, Swift Charts bar chart (historical + forecast, last 6)
states       : loading (skeletons), empty (No forecast data), error (QueryError +
               retry), stale (chip + cached), offline (cached + offline chip)
i18n         : translation.widget.costForecast.{title,noData,nextMonth,trend,
               avgPerKwh,costLabel} — all 6 already present in the P1/S10 catalog
               (apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings); freshness chips
               reuse widget.freshness.{stale,offline}; retry reuses common.retry.
a11y         : VoiceOver labels on stats, chart bars (month + formatted cost),
               refresh control; Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens; Reduce Motion via
               shared skeleton/animation components.
telemetry    : view-opened signal for surface slug "CostForecastWidget" via the
               CostForecastTelemetry seam (host maps to TelemetryEvent.ScreenView).

